  "name": "Abandoned Cart Recovery | Ranime Jemal Agency",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Abandoned Cart Recovery (Shopify)\nSaves every checkout, marks it recovered when the order is placed, and every hour emails customers who left items behind: a first reminder after `firstDelayHours`, then every `repeatHours`, up to `maxReminders`. The AI writes each email from the cart contents; the discount code (optional) is only offered from the second reminder.\nOnly email customers who agreed to marketing emails where the law requires it.\n1. Fill in **Settings**. 2. Make a sheet with a **Carts** tab (`carts-sheet.csv`). 3. Connect Shopify (access token), Google Sheets, Gmail and OpenAI. 4. Activate.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 4
      },
